{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_038_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:86b94d834d6a3435e0e5c165a03581efe7c5244b785c0af4008074b3c52a88d9",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11580911dcf0efef2561b87ffa6d19e8570a5b3c07f94f2a65d408e8ca3db0fb",
      "text": "道流和制作人正为武的生日派对做准备，\n而涟却在一旁无所事事。\n他们借由慰问便当探查武的口味偏好，推进筹备。\n生日派对能否顺利举行呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70784edd450e03aa6a5d3af95e5405f7d5fb4ee41390df6c9c688d5e1e1f933a",
      "text": "为了谁的生日派对",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a643f0a6f483c15f20f9aa770cb74cb73f8789c65bb14cb4e80838d3de994f8",
      "text": "那么今天也赶紧开始商量\n武的生日派对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dff2fcbac3c7d4adc1eda94b6ee41c18614e12b00ee6ba29907a98809148bfc",
      "text": "师父，请多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af7d5e7fe4aa5c59dc73749c4d7113af16d8ed561bc1a6f4473b1150f0442ee0",
      "text": "好的。首先确认一下上次为止的内容，\n当天由我去蛋糕店取蛋糕……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68e488eac7f533519a9dd10aacd1e92d52bf1898a05c3ee1343c4ee06c598e95",
      "text": "在那期间，由道流先生负责准备料理对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dea662746b4022d83a37b1356a2bf76e0d566bc0e4c8b0cdd5e447ba1fe46ef1",
      "text": "是的！要做什么我也已经定好了。\n主菜是炸物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b33325ef36bac2e5108babd0e4534b06b15f65de0c7e4141978df5611bce1df9",
      "text": "虽然大部分会在我家提前做好，\n但炸物果然还是现炸的才好吃嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc4c81b65afb3bcfdaffcd9d8377b6d8329941daf858825454da5574f1c1cb4",
      "text": "因为我想让武在最好吃的瞬间吃上。\n当然，师父你们也是！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28f54458231e0880fc6dfedcf36bf4b2c8a3381ad7a41babea5126fffe78fd49",
      "text": "我也很期待道流先生的料理。\n如果还需要其他什么东西，请尽管说哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c06d8a499e5c7580f9b4d310ce18575c5e15b3466fc52b07dcbb5ed3d6e6ce8",
      "text": "嗯——……呼啊啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d0ced6dbf8ff38f9e66c3533a2a36a3de950a471b19c9d2e5961b884780f780",
      "text": "早啊，涟。你也来参加\n武的生日派对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5298a7136d8d514a4ca50244403786549047b94fec4ef23ca5cfad54515b0519",
      "text": "啊？本大爷凭什么要参加那种玩意儿。\n又没有给小不点庆祝的义务。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:483fe6ed189d51a261593375d78e7e70f1f4f962bc1748a4677109ecd88ee515",
      "text": "好啦好啦别这么说。当天会准备\n很多丰盛大餐的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72041e41d743c10dceb9cc65cb365675ad14474537f7108d22a2a337ece6463c",
      "text": "而且，到了涟生日的时候我也会做你喜欢吃的东西哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9398ce6bf9d6fb8a0b3d40eb10023e8bf2ad442f72f26ab97ad6fc5fbb0eb49",
      "text": "本大爷以外的人过生日根本无所谓……但这次\n算例外的。小不点那份我也要吃光！库哈哈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfe0c179136b76155f10d1706593742eecb2f3d4828b1090e136fa0116c6ab02",
      "text": "请给主角武先生留一份哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_038tak_02_1_2_038_02:1_2_038_02_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b8d7eb1f68840662f60e647deea0a8d3f4c0cee24ed65fec4a874c735990992",
      "text": "我会做到吃都吃不完的程度，没问题的！\n就放心地交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
